  },
  {
   "x": 7.85,
   "y": 2.0,
   "w": 5.0,
   "h": 0.2702777777777778,
   "text": "Tₛₕ = G_g γ + η_g γ̇",
   "font": "Arial",
   "font_size": 13,
   "color": "#E7F0F3",
   "word_wrap": false,
   "align": "left",
   "valign": "top",
   "margin": 0.02,
   "bold": true,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "o040",
   "name": "A-E17 text 40"
  },
  {
   "x": 7.85,
   "y": 2.55,
   "w": 5.0,
   "h": 0.26180555555555557,
   "text": "Tₛₕ = 0:  γ̇ = −(G_g/η_g) γ",
   "font": "Arial",
   "font_size": 12.5,
   "color": "#E7F0F3",
   "word_wrap": false,
   "align": "left",
   "valign": "top",
   "margin": 0.02,
   "bold": true,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "o041",
   "name": "A-E17 text 41"
  },
  {
   "x": 7.85,
   "y": 3.1,
   "w": 5.0,
   "h": 0.26180555555555557,
   "text": "γ = γ₀ exp(−t/τ_KV),   τ_KV = η_g/G_g",
   "font": "Arial",
   "font_size": 12.5,
   "color": "#F2B880",
   "word_wrap": false,
   "align": "left",
   "valign": "top",
   "margin": 0.02,
   "bold": true,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "o042",
   "name": "A-E17 text 42"
  },
  {
   "x": 7.85,
   "y": 3.7,
   "w": 5.0,
   "h": 0.2702777777777778,
   "text": "τ_KV = 0.010 / 20 000 = 0.50 µs",
   "font": "Arial",
   "font_size": 13,
   "color": "#F2B880",
   "word_wrap": false,
   "align": "left",
   "valign": "top",
   "margin": 0.02,
   "bold": true,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "o043",
   "name": "A-E17 text 43"
  },
  {
   "x": 7.85,
   "y": 4.3,
   "w": 5.0,
   "h": 0.4397222222222222,
   "text": "This is the recovery time after unloading; it is not a\nrelaxation time for stress under constant strain.",
   "font": "Arial",
   "font_size": 11.5,
   "color": "#B4C7D2",
   "word_wrap": false,
   "align": "left",
   "valign": "top",
   "margin": 0.02,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "o044",
   "name": "A-E17 text 44"
  },
  {
   "x": 1.0,
   "y": 6.27,
   "w": 12,
   "h": 0.26180555555555557,
   "text": "A Kelvin–Voigt solid recovers strain exponentially; it cannot relax stress at constant strain, so τ_KV must not be reused as τᵣₑₗ.",
   "font": "Arial",
   "font_size": 12.5,
   "color": "#E7F0F3",
   "word_wrap": false,
   "align": "left",
   "valign": "top",
   "margin": 0.02,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "o045",
   "name": "A-E17 text 45"
  },
